# "Planeswalkers you control": Bot2's Narset, Parter of Veils (turn 2) has no "[-2]: Create ... Cadet. Surveil 1" (the refusal), while
# her printed "Look" -2 is offered to Bot2 (so the loyalty would have allowed one). The positive control is Bot1's own Jace token
# using the granted -2 on turn 3 and making a Cadet.

